<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Level One started at buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Level One started at buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Thursday it initiated coverage of Level One Communications Inc with a buy rating and a one-year price target of $53 a share.</p>
<p>-- expects earnings to grow at annual rate of 28 to 30 percent over next five years.</p>
<p>-- estimates 1997 earnings of $1.21 a share, 1998 of $1.61 a share and 1999 of $2.12 a share.</p>
<p>-- says company's near term &quot;promising with new products in position to begin volume shipments and contribute materially to growth.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Level One shares up 1-3/8 at 42-1/8.</p>
</text>
